# Tributary Vaulter: "another target Merfolk you control" is a Merfolk permanent, not only a creature (CR 109.2: a description with a
# subtype and without "card" or "spell" means a permanent). Firdoch Core, a Kindred Artifact with changeling, is every creature type
# and so a Merfolk while it is not a creature (CR 205.3m, 702.73a). Bot1's Vaulter attacks on turn 3 and its trigger targets the
# Core, the only other Merfolk Bot1 controls; the Core gets +2/+0 until end of turn (CR 611.2c), which shows once Bot1 makes it a
# 4/4 artifact creature in the second main phase: a 6/4.

